      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wisdomlib.org/cities/murraysville-27139",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Rivers nearby once served as vital transport routes, linking Murraysville to larger markets in the 19th century.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
